<title>PORTUGAL: Escudo ends calm vs mark, ignores firmer peseta.</title>
<headline>Escudo ends calm vs mark, ignores firmer peseta.</headline>
<text>
<p>1655 GMT - The Portuguese escudo closed steady against the mark, not reacting to the appreciation of the peseta and the French franc, dealers said. It traded in a narrow range throughout the session, ending at 100.94/97 per mark, compared with 100.95/98 at the opening.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
